    "title": "NWS confirms at least 7 tornadoes touched down in Tuesday storm - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rachel Ryan ,\n9 hours ago WISCONSIN — At least seven tornadoes touched down on Tuesday during severe storms, the National Weather Service confirmed. NWS said an EF-2 tornado touched down in the Town of Lisbon, which is just north of Sussex, on April 14. It had maximum winds of 120 mph and traveled for 3.2 miles for a total of six minutes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 13",
